// Presentation slides at 1920 x 1080
// Shows: a deck as frames in reading order, one idea per slide, type no smaller than 28 px on a 1920 px slide, content that fills the slide, a footer component with a page number property on its own page, a chart with axis values, exporting the frames to one PDF
// then: figcraft-cli export deck.figcraft -o deck.pdf
// Foundations: semantic colour variables, then text and effect styles. Interface layers bind to these, never to raw hex; literal colours are for artwork and for data series beyond the brand.
